Description: Multi-tab text editor (Linux port of Notepad++)
 Nextpad++ is a native Linux port of the Notepad++ text editor, built
 on Scintilla and Lexilla with GTK 4. It supports multi-tab editing,
 syntax highlighting for 50+ languages, user-defined languages,
 find/replace with regex, macro recording, session save/restore,
 auto-backup, side panels (Document List, Function List, Document Map,
 Folder Tree, Search Results, Character Panel, Clipboard History,
 Project), bookmark margin, 5-colour mark/style system, command
 palette, and a plugin SDK compatible with Notepad++ for macOS.
